# --- ReyOS additions: KDE Plasma live/install desktop ---
networkmanager
plasma-desktop
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
plasma-workspace
# plasma-workspace only ships the Wayland session (kwin_wayland) --
# plasma-x11-session provides kwin_x11 + the X11 xsession entry, which
# is the only thing that can produce a real desktop in environments
# without a GPU/DRM render node (e.g. VMs without 3D-accelerated video,
# like the dev/test VMs this ISO gets validated in): kwin_wayland just
# spins forever failing "Failed to open drm node" with no fallback.
# Confirmed live on the dev VM 2026-08-11.
plasma-x11-session
# qt6-base (pulled in transitively by KDE frameworks like kxmlgui/kconfig)
# depends on the virtual opengl-driver/libgl packages. With mesa/nvidia
# variants available across the cachyos-v3/cachyos-extra-v3/cachyos/extra
# repos, pacman can't auto-resolve the provider and mkarchiso hangs at an
# interactive "Enter a number" prompt during a non-interactive build.
# Pin the plain open-source mesa/libglvnd explicitly so it resolves without
# asking -- matches what's already used on the dev/test VMs (virtio video,
# no GPU passthrough). Confirmed blocking mkarchiso 2026-08-11.
mesa
libglvnd
sddm
# sddm's Depends are Qt6-only, but the breeze greeter theme needs Qt5
# QML (libQt5Quick/Qml/Network/Gui/Core) -- qt5-declarative is only an
# *optional* dep of sddm, so pacman never pulls it in on its own.
# Without it the greeter binary fails to exec (dynamic linker can't
# resolve those libs) and sddm crash-loops with "exited with 127" --
# confirmed live on the dev VM 2026-08-11, ldd showed all 5 as "not found".
qt5-declarative
kwin
konsole
dolphin
dolphin-plugins
kate
ark
okular
gwenview
kscreen
kdeplasma-addons
bluedevil
breeze
breeze-gtk
kdialog
qt6-svg
